### Conceder recurso a rol (temporalmente sin auth hasta ISS-13)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@id = 1

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role_id": 1, "resource_id": 1 }

### Retirar recurso
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol/{{id}}/deactivate

### Reactivar recurso
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol/{{id}}/reactivate